## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
1. Run `cross_evaluate.py` which will:
   - Load all 3 CHALO CSVs and engine output
   - Compute all metrics with pass/fail indicators
   - Generate diagnostic charts
   - Output a markdown calibration report
2. Iterate: adjust engine constants → re-run engine → re-run evaluator → check convergence

### Manual Verification
- Review the fleet scatter plot (CHALO deployed vs Engine computed) for the 30 SSCL routes
- Compare system-wide monthly KM totals against CHALO operated KM
- Validate the hourly demand curve matches the engine's peak-hour constants
